{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 523 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cefotetan has been on FDA's shortage list since 2014-08-14 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21, a span of 146 months.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product used across Corvale sites carries NDC 63323038510 labeled by Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC and is manufactured at ACS DOBFAR SPA (FEI 3006028606) in Italy.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected that plant on 2016-01-19 and classified it OAI with 14 observations on laboratory controls and documentation, 523 days after the shortage was first posted.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter followed on 2017-01-13 for the same facility.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2017, 2018, 2022, and 2024 returned VAI classifications.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E13", "E14", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer, PAI Holdings, LLC dba PAI Pharma (NDC 00121097610), is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D14", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The highest-ranked action is to transfer 11 vials of the 1 g/10 mL presentation from Corvale Lakeside, which holds 27 days on hand, to Corvale East, which holds 9.5 days and would reach 12 days after the move.",
      "cites": ["D13", "D1", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
